<title>UK: British Steel, Ramco firm  sign jv.</title>
<headline>British Steel, Ramco firm  sign jv.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Steel said on Monday that it had signed a joint venture with Ramco Oil Services Ltd, a unit of Ramco Energy Plc, for providing services to the pipeline industry.</p>
<p>The 50:50 joint venture will be called British Steel Ramco Pipeline Services Ltd (BSR).</p>
<p>The venture would offer new facilities for the provision of single and multi-layer coatings and associated services to the pipeline industry.</p>
<p>The firm would mainly cater to UK and North Sea markets.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
